OL,3,GNEWSASoaring fuel costs hit small
OL,4,Abusinesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmall businesses are bearing the brunt
OL,7,Fof rising fuel prices, the owner of a
OL,8,Fhaulage company has said.
OL,10,FNoel Lewis, who runs Lewis Light
OL,11,FHaulage & Storage in
OL,12,FStourport-on-Severn, Worcestershire,
OL,13,Fsaid he was having to absorb thousands
OL,14,Fof pounds a month in extra costs due to
OL,15,Fthe price of fuel.
OL,17,FHis comments come as fuel prices -
OL,18,Fdriven by conflict in the Middle East -
OL,19,Freach their highest point since 2022,
OL,20,Fwith diesel averaging at #1.92 per
OL,21,Flitre according to the RAC.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
